{"text": "P", "added": false}], "options_source": "real", "image_only": true, "topic": "Simplification", "sub": "other", "key_answer": null}, {"n": 9, "text": "Monthly salary of Jitvik in the month of December 2020 was ₹24,800. Every year his salary increases by 5% from the month of January. What was his salary (in ₹) in the month of February 2022?", "options": [{"text": "27342", "added": false}, {"text": "26485", "added": false}, {"text": "27486", "added": false}, {"text": "27180", "added": false}], "options_source": "real", "image_only": false, "topic": "Percentage", "sub": "income-expenditure", "key_answer": null}, {"n": 10, "text": "The population of a town first decreased by 16% due to migration to a big city for better job opportunities. The next year, the population of the town increased by 21% as there were better facilities for jobs. What is the net percentage change (correct to 2 decimal places) in the population?", "options": [{"text": "Decrease by 2.54%", "added": false}, {"text": "Increase by 2.54%", "added": false}, {"text": "Increase by 1.64%", "added": false}, {"text": "Decrease by 1.64%", "added": false}], "options_source": "real", "image_only": false, "topic": "Percentage", "sub": "population-and-depreciation", "key_answer": null}, {"n": 11, "text": "", "options": [], "options_source": "missing", "image_only": true, "topic": "Simplification", "sub": "other", "key_answer": null}, {"n": 12, "text": "If 3c2933k is divisible by both 5 and 11, where c and k are single digit natural numbers, then c + k = ______.", "options": [{"text": "7", "added": false}, {"text": "8", "added": false}, {"text": "6", "added": false}, {"text": "5", "added": false}], "options_source": "real", "image_only": false, "topic": "Number System", "sub": "divisibility-rules", "key_answer": null}, {"n": 13, "text": "Raju has ₹11,000 and starts saving ₹5,000 each week towards buying a new laptop. At the same time, Ramesh has ₹60,000 and begins spending ₹2,000 per week on supplies for his art class. Will there be a week when they have the same amount of money?", "options": [{"text": "Yes, after 7 weeks", "added": false}, {"text": "Yes, after 6 weeks", "added": false}, {"text": "No, they will never have the same amount", "added": false}, {"text": "Yes, after 5 weeks", "added": false}], "options_source": "real", "image_only": false, "topic": "Simplification", "sub": "other", "key_answer": null}, {"n": 14, "text": "", "options": [{"text": "₹186 crores", "added": false}, {"text": "₹294 crores", "added": false}, {"text": "₹150 crores", "added": false}, {"text": "₹268 crores", "added": false}], "options_source": "real", "image_only": true, "topic": "Simplification", "sub": "other", "key_answer": null}, {"n": 15, "text": "", "options": [], "options_source": "missing", "image_only": true, "topic": "Simplification", "sub": "other", "key_answer": null}, {"n": 16, "text": "The length, breadth and height of a cuboid are in ratio of 3 : 4 : 5. If the volume of the cuboid is 1620 m3, find the total surface area of the cuboid.", "options": [{"text": "646 m2", "added": false}, {"text": "846 m2", "added": false}, {"text": "423 m2", "added": false}, {"text": "712 m2", "added": false}], "options_source": "real", "image_only": false, "topic": "Mensuration 3D", "sub": "cube-cuboid", "key_answer": null}, {"n": 17, "text": "The difference between 31% and 26% of votes for the same party at different places is 2350. What is 7% of those votes?", "options": [{"text": "2270", "added": false}, {"text": "3090", "added": false}, {"text": "4090", "added": false}, {"text": "3290", "added": false}], "options_source": "real", "image_only": false, "topic": "Percentage", "sub": "basic-percentage", "key_answer": null}, {"n": 18, "text": "Ravath had to sell vegetables worth ₹4,960 for ₹4,712 due to weather conditions. What is the loss percentage that he has incurred?", "options": [{"text": "20%", "added": false}, {"text": "10%", "added": false}, {"text": "5%", "added": false}, {"text": "15%", "added": false}], "options_source": "real", "image_only": false, "topic": "Profit-Loss", "sub": "basic-cp-sp", "key_answer": null}, {"n": 19, "text": "∆ABC is similar to ∆DEF and the ratio of the area of triangle ABC to triangle DEF is 25 ∶ 144. If AB = p cm,AC = q cm and BC = r cm,then DE = ?", "options": [], "options_source": "missing", "image_only": false, "topic": "Mensuration 2D", "sub": "triangle-and-quadrilaterals", "key_answer": null}, {"n": 20, "text": "", "options": [], "options_source": "missing", "image_only": true, "topic": "Simplification", "sub": "other", "key_answer": null}, {"n": 21, "text": "", "options": [], "options_source": "missing", "image_only": true, "topic": "Simplification", "sub": "other", "key_answer": null}, {"n": 22, "text": "", "options": [{"text": "45", "added": false}, {"text": "61", "added": false}, {"text": "73", "added": false}, {"text": "56", "added": false}], "options_source": "real", "image_only": true, "topic": "Simplification", "sub": "other", "key_answer": null}, {"n": 23, "text": "", "options": [{"text": "15.8 million", "added": false}, {"text": "16.8 million", "added": false}, {"text": "17.8 million", "added": false}, {"text": "14.8 million", "added": false}], "options_source": "real", "image_only": true, "topic": "Simplification", "sub": "other", "key_answer": null}, {"n": 24, "text": "In triangle XYZ, XY = YZ and m∠ X = 78°. Find the value of m∠ Y.", "options": [{"text": "28°", "added": false}, {"text": "24°", "added": false}, {"text": "34°", "added": false}, {"text": "39°", "added": false}], "options_source": "real", "image_only": false, "topic": "Geometry", "sub": "triangles", "key_answer": null}, {"n": 25, "text": "If a : b = 3 : 4, b : c = 2 : 3, and c : d = 5 : 6, then a : b : c : d is:", "options": [], "options_source": "missing", "image_only": false, "topic": "Ratio-Proportion", "sub": "ratio-basics", "key_answer": null}]}